      "vision_reason": "This is a lacquered wood box with silver-under-red-lacquer decoration made in Palembang, a Chinese-influenced Peranakan craft tradition of the region, plausible as a Sumatran/Indonesian regional object even though the motifs are Chinese-derived; it is not a textile despite the claimed category.",
